sequenceDiagram
  participant E as Existing sync
  participant T as ManagedSync
  participant A as ArchiveGuard
  participant P as T03 pnpm runner
  participant D as T02 CandidateDependencies
  participant G as GraphInspector
  participant B as T01 backup owner
  E->>T: await run(request) under profile lock
  T->>A: freeze(request, destination)
  T->>P: await runPnpm(list, controlled env)
  T->>G: capture({listJson}), validate before
  alt exact managed no-op
    T->>A: recheck input and path binding
    T-->>E: unchanged
  else adoption
    T->>A: probeRecovery(paths)
    T->>D: prepareCandidateDependencies(options with runPnpm)
    D->>P: candidate lock generation
    D->>G: compare non-target lock
    D->>P: controlled private acquisition then frozen offline install
    D-->>T: lockDigest, storeRef, acquisition
    T->>G: capture candidate and compare full graph
    T->>B: RecoveryInput for two non-secret staging files
    B-->>T: verified RecoveryReceipt
    T->>T: recheck before and durable PREPARED
    T->>A: safeMove four-item publication with durable intents
    T->>G: validate actual live state
    alt valid
      T->>T: durable COMMITTED, compact receipt and owned cleanup
      T-->>E: committed
    else failure or supported interruption
      T->>P: terminate and wait for owned workers
      T->>A: reverse recorded moves idempotently
      T->>G: verify restored before
      T-->>E: recovered failure or recovery-required
    end
  end
